unt", "Metabolic storage disorder: unlikely at 57 years old without family history", "Diabetic complication syndrome: inconsistent with blasts and pancytopenia", "Infectious myelitis: lacks focal neuro signs to support spinal localization", "Paraneoplastic neurological syndrome: requires direct CNS involvement evidence not present"], "alarm_features": ["Constitutional symptoms (fever, weight loss, night sweats)", "Blasts in peripheral blood", "Pancytopenia with leukocytosis"]}, "branches": {"B1": {"id": "B1", "label": "Myeloid Neoplasm with Increased Blasts", "parent": "ROOT", "level": 1, "status": "reopened", "prior": 0.029060512424484056, "posterior": 0.029060512424484056, "danger": 0.9, "actionability": 0.0, "explanatory_coverage": 0.0, "expand_score": 0.0, "evidence_for": [], "evidence_against": [], "unresolved_questions": [], "children": [], "closure_reason": "", "turn_cost_to_refine": 2.0, "diagnosis_commitment_gain": 0.4, "interrupt_relevance": 0.7, "level_role": "family", "classification_axis": "mechanism", "representative_diseases": ["acute myeloid leukemia", "myelodysplastic syndrome with excess blasts", "chronic myeloid leukemia in blast crisis"]}, "B2": {"id": "B2", "label": "Lymphoid Neoplasm with Increased Blasts", "parent": "ROOT", "level": 1, "status": "expanded", "prior": 0.05395967620311824, "posterior": 0.05395967620311824, "danger": 0.85, "actionability": 0.0, "explanatory_coverage": 0.0, "expand_score": 0.0, "evidence_for": [], "evidence_against": [], "unresolved_questions": [], "children": [], "closure_reason": "", "turn_cost_to_refine": 1.5, "diagnosis_commitment_gain": 0.3, "interrupt_relevance": 0.6, "level_role": "family", "classification_axis": "mechanism", "representative_diseases": ["acute lymphoblastic leukemia", "lymphoblastic lymphoma"]}, "B3": {"id": "B3", "label": "Chronic Myeloproliferative Neoplasm", "parent": "ROOT", "level": 1, "status": "expanded", "prior": 0.5814426519688038, "posterior": 0.5814426519688038, "danger": 0.65, "a